day, and a p95 latency target of 50 ms.\",\"title\":\"A withdrawn benchmark: should search move to Quarry?\"}"},{"node":"nc9864a7ba487","v":1,"at":"2026-10-05T09:00:00+00:00","by":"curator","reason":"","body":"{\"text\":\"Is the Quarry engine fast enough to move our search service to it?\",\"why\":\"The migration decision depends on the answer.\"}"},{"node":"n746690a48e31","v":1,"at":"2026-10-05T09:00:00+00:00","by":"curator","reason":"","body":"{\"citation\":\"Quarry vendor benchmark report, October edition.\",\"passage\":\"On the 10-million-document corpus, Quarry answered queries with a p95 latency of 38 ms.\",\"reliability\":\"Published by the vendor; not reproduced by us.\"}"},{"node":"n71956b7ba637","v":1,"at":"2026-10-06T10:00:00+00:00","by":"ana","reason":"","body":"{\"kind\":\"computed\",\"outcome\":\"positive\",\"summary\":\"From the vendor's 38 ms and our engine's 118 ms at p95, Quarry is 3.1 times faster.\",\"values\":{\"current_p95_ms\":118,\"quarry_p95_ms\":38,\"speedup\":3.1}}"},{"node":"n4e3e313140c0","v":1,"at":"2026-10-06T10:00:00+00:00","by":"ana","reason":"","body":"{\"kind\":\"finding\",\"measurements\":[{\"key\":\"speedup\",\"name\":\"p95 speed-up\",\"result\":\"n71956b7ba637\",\"value\":3.1},{\"key\":\"quarry_p95_ms\",\"name\":\"Quarry p95 latency (ms)\",\"result\":\"n71956b7ba637\",\"value\":38},{\"key\":\"current_p95_ms\",\"name\":\"current engine p95 latency (ms)\",\"result\":\"n71956b7ba637\",\"value\":118}],\"scope\":\"p95 latency: the vendor's corpus for Quarry, ours for the current engine.\",\"statement\":\"Quarry answers queries 3.1 times faster than our current engine at p95.\"}"},{"node":"nbf6dcb24991f","v":1,"at":"2026-10-06T10:00:00+00:00","by":"ana","reason":"","body":"{\"kind\":\"computed\",\"outcome\":\"positive\",\"summary\":\"At 3.1 times the speed with twice the headroom, today's peak load needs 8 of the 12 servers.\",\"values\":{\"headroom\":2,\"servers_needed\":8,\"servers_now\":12}}"},{"node":"n17be9a1ed1fc","v":1,"at":"2026-10-06T10:00:00+00:00","by":"ana","reason":"","body":"{\"kind\":\"finding\",\"measurements\":[{\"key\":\"servers_needed\",\"name\":\"servers needed\",\"result\":\"nbf6dcb24991f\",\"value\":8},{\"key\":\"servers_now\",\"name\":\"servers today\",\"result\":\"nbf6dcb24991f\",\"value\":12},{\"key\":\"headroom\",\"name\":\"headroom factor\",\"result\":\"nbf6dcb24991f\",\"value\":2}],\"scope\":\"Today's peak load; capacity scales with p95 latency.\",\"statement\":\"With Quarry, 8 of our 12 search servers carry today's peak load with twice the headroom.\"}"},{"node":"nf8b30ea38dfd","v":1,"at":"2026-10-07T10:00:00+00:00","by":"lab","reason":"","body":"{\"kind\":\"lab\",\"name\":\"Load test of Quarry on our corpus and a day of our query log, cold cache.\",\"state\":\"succeeded\"}"},{"node":"n6cfe8266189e","v":1,"at":"2026-10-07T10:00:00+00:00","by":"lab","reason":"","body":"{\"kind\":\"computed\",\"outcome\":\"positive\",\"summary\":\"On our corpus, Quarry's p95 latency was 44 ms against the 50 ms target.\",\"values\":{\"own_p95_ms\":44,\"target_ms\":50}}"},{"node":"n32481d24e3aa","v":1,"at":"2026-10-07T10:00:00+00:00","by":"ana","reason":"","body":"{\"kind\":\"finding\",\"measurements\":[{\"key\":\"own_p95_ms\",\"name\":\"Quarry p95 latency on our corpus (ms)\",\"result\":\"n6cfe8266189e\",\"value\":44},{\"key\":\"target_ms\",\"name\":\"p95 latency target (ms)\",\"result\":\"n6cfe8266189e\",\"value\":50}],\"scope\":\"Our corpus and a day of our query log, cold cache.\",\"statement\":\"On our own corpus, Quarry's p95 latency is 44 ms, inside the 50 ms target.\"}"},{"node":"nff2cfac1ec04","v":1,"at":"2026-10-07T10:00:00+00:00","by":"rhea","reason":"","body":"{\"method\":\"Re-ran the load test from its log and read the latency histogram.\",\"notes\":\"44 ms at p95 on the team's corpus, cold cache; the target is 50 ms.\",\"official\":true,\"verdict\":\"checked\"}"},{"node":"nd21852ffcba9","v":1,"at":"2026-10-09T10:00:00+00:00","by":"lead","reason":"","body":"{\"alternatives\":[\"Stay on the current engine and add servers as load grows.\"],\"choice\":\"Move search to Quarry next quarter and retire 4 of the 12 servers.\",\"reasons\":\"Quarry is 3.1 times faster at p95, inside our target on our own corpus, and needs 8 servers, not 12.\",\"revisit_if\":\"The benchmark or our own load test changes.\"}"}],"edges":[{"id":1,"src":"n71956b7ba637","src_v":1,"rel":"derived_from","dst":"n746690a48e31","dst_v":1,"data":"{}","at":"2026-10-06T10:00:00+00:00","by":"ana","why":"Quarry's p95 is the vendor's figure."},{"id":2,"src":"n4e3e313140c0","src_v":1,"rel":"derived_from","dst":"n71956b7ba637","dst_v":1,"data":"{}","at":"2026-10-06T10:00:00+00:00","by":"ana","why":"The speed-up is computed there."},{"id":3,"src":"n4e3e313140c0","src_v":1,"rel":"answers","dst":"nc9864a7ba487","dst_v":1,"data":"{}","at":"2026-10-06T10:00:00+00:00","by":"ana","why":""},{"id":4,"src":"nbf6dcb24991f","src_v":1,"rel":"derived_from","dst":"n71956b7ba637","dst_v":1,"data":"{}","at":"2026-10-06T10:00:00+00:00","by":"ana","why":"Capacity scales with the p95 speed-up."},{"id":5,"src":"n17be9a1ed1fc","src_v":1,"rel":"derived_from","dst":"nbf6dcb24991f","dst_v":1,"data":"{}","at":"2026-10-06T10:00:00+00:00","by":"ana","why":"The capacity sum."},{"id":6,"src":"n17be9a1ed1fc","src_v":1,"rel":"requires","dst":"n4e3e313140c0","dst_v":1,"data":"{}","at":"2026-10-06T10:00:00+00:00","by":"ana","why":"The server count follows from the speed-up."},{"id":7,"src":"nf8b30ea38dfd","src_v":1,"rel":"produced","dst":"n6cfe8266189e","dst_v":1,"data":"{}","at":"2026-10-07T10:00:00+00:00","by":"lab","why":""},{"id":8,"src":"n6cfe8266189e","src_v":1,"rel":"supports","dst":"n32481d24e3aa","dst_v":1,"data":"{}","at":"2026-10-07T10:00:00+00:00","by":"ana","why":"Our own load test."},{"id":9,"src":"n32481d24e3aa","src_v":1,"rel":"answers","dst":"nc9864a7ba487","dst_v":1,"data":"{}","at":"2026-10-07T10:00:00+00:00","by":"ana","why":""},{"id":10,"src":"nff2cfac1ec04","src_v":1,"rel":"reviews","dst":"n324